{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function hotkey(hotkey, options?): <T>(proto, propertyKey, descriptor?) => void;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/decorators/hotkey.ts#L29","children":[{"type":"text","value":"decorators/hotkey.ts:29"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Decorator that registers a keyboard hotkey on the element when it connects\nand unregisters when it disconnects. Uses "},{"type":"link","href":"../classes/HotkeyController.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"HotkeyController"}]},{"type":"text","value":" under the hood."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"hotkey","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RegisterableHotkey"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The key or key combo to listen for (e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"'Mod+S'"},{"type":"text","value":" or a raw hotkey object)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"options?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HotkeyOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" = "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"HOTKEY_DEFAULT_OPTIONS"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional registration options (target, platform, enabled, etc.)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A method decorator for use on LitElement methods."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":">("},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"proto"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"propertyKey"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"descriptor?"},{"type":"text","value":") => "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"class MyElement extends LitElement {\n  @hotkey('Mod+S')\n  save() { this.doSave() }\n\n  @hotkey('Escape')\n  close() { this.dismiss() }\n}","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"hotkey","text":"hotkey","level":3},{"id":"options","text":"options?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction hotkey(hotkey, options?): <T>(proto, propertyKey, descriptor?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [decorators/hotkey.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/decorators/hotkey.ts#L29)\n\nDecorator that registers a keyboard hotkey on the element when it connects\nand unregisters when it disconnects. Uses [HotkeyController](../classes/HotkeyController.md) under the hood.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### hotkey\n\n`RegisterableHotkey`\n\nThe key or key combo to listen for (e.g. `'Mod+S'` or a raw hotkey object).\n\n### options?\n\n`HotkeyOptions` = `HOTKEY_DEFAULT_OPTIONS`\n\nOptional registration options (target, platform, enabled, etc.).\n\n## Returns\n\nA method decorator for use on LitElement methods.\n\n\\<`T`\\>(`proto`, `propertyKey`, `descriptor?`) => `void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass MyElement extends LitElement {\n  @hotkey('Mod+S')\n  save() { this.doSave() }\n\n  @hotkey('Escape')\n  close() { this.dismiss() }\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: hotkey\ntitle: hotkey\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction hotkey(hotkey, options?): <T>(proto, propertyKey, descriptor?) => void;\n```\n\nDefined in: [decorators/hotkey.ts:29](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/lit-hotkeys/src/decorators/hotkey.ts#L29)\n\nDecorator that registers a keyboard hotkey on the element when it connects\nand unregisters when it disconnects. Uses [HotkeyController](../classes/HotkeyController.md) under the hood.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### hotkey\n\n`RegisterableHotkey`\n\nThe key or key combo to listen for (e.g. `'Mod+S'` or a raw hotkey object).\n\n### options?\n\n`HotkeyOptions` = `HOTKEY_DEFAULT_OPTIONS`\n\nOptional registration options (target, platform, enabled, etc.).\n\n## Returns\n\nA method decorator for use on LitElement methods.\n\n\\<`T`\\>(`proto`, `propertyKey`, `descriptor?`) => `void`\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nclass MyElement extends LitElement {\n  @hotkey('Mod+S')\n  save() { this.doSave() }\n\n  @hotkey('Escape')\n  close() { this.dismiss() }\n}\n```\n"}
